TEXT -568 376 Left 0 !.param seed = {RNUM} % 100.0\n.param lcg = (2175143*seed + 10653) % 100\n.param Gain = 300\n \n.param Vpp=(lcg)*0.0001\n.meas _Vpp param Vpp\n \n.MEAS TRAN Vmax MAX V(Vout)\n.MEAS TRAN Vmin MIN V(Vout)\n.MEAS TRAN Vswing PARAM Vmax-Vmin\n.MEAS TRAN Vavg AVG V(Vout)\n \n.MEAS TRAN GainError PARAM (Gain - Vmax/Vpp) * 100 / Gain\n.MEAS TRAN AvgError PARAM Vavg * 100
TEXT 56 96 Left 2 ;Project 5:\nUsing only resistors, capacitors, and NPN transistors (2N3904)\nAchieve a gain of 300V/V, centered around 0.\n \nRules:\n- Resistors must be below 1Meg\n- No RF Chokes\n- Output must be centered around zero\n- NPN cannot break (Power exceed datasheet limits)\n- Do not move anything inside of this box\n- Place your r-number at "RNUM"\n \nPlace "VIN" at the start of your amplifier, and\n"VOUT" at the end. You may use multiple stages.
